{"id": "34438", "title": "相公很难搞", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 53, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34438.htm", "intro": "她是钱府两宝中的“银娃娃”，打小穿“银”戴“银”，是块会走路的大银子！为了逃离她那败家散金到不行的小姐，她决定替自己找个能陪她走遍天下的亲亲相公。这块好心救了她的愣木头，竟然在看过她的肚兜、摸过她的“小山峰”之后，还傻愣愣地把她当作“小兄弟”，这教她如何不生气！看在他呆得好耍弄的份上，她就勉为其难地选他当相公吧！谁知道这块木头不但不解风情、不懂得圆房，还乐善好施到忙著助人而忘了老婆的地步，一点也不懂她女儿家的心事，还反问她什么是爱！哦，天哪！她这个呆相公怎么那么难搞啊！……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34438", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2185949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2185950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2185951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2185952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2185953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2185954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2185955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2185956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2185957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2185958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2185959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2185960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2185961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2185962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2185963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2185964.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2185966.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2185967.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2185968.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2185969.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2185970.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2185971.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2185972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2185973.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "fi